{"id":"n14126-2-6","stage":3,"title":"실컷 · 狠狠地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14126-2-6-1","ko":"네가 실컷 혼나 봐야 정신을 차리겠구나.","zh":"你得好好挨顿骂才能醒醒脑吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"실컷","meaning":"狠狠地","explanation":"실컷：狠狠地","readings":[{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14126","senseId":"2","lemma":"실컷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}},{"text":"혼나","meaning":"被大骂，被怒斥","explanation":"혼나다：被大骂，被怒斥；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"혼나다","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87966","senseId":"2","lemma":"혼나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼나","audio":"/audio/b21134dca2712a6a522e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐야","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐야","audio":"/audio/3326ab465da6795a458b.mp3"}},{"text":"정신을","meaning":"精神","explanation":"정신：精神；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"정신","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75789","senseId":"2","lemma":"정신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정신을","audio":"/audio/abdea51d17e089a24761.mp3"}},{"text":"차리겠구나.","meaning":"振作，抖擞","explanation":"차리다：振作，抖擞；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"차리다","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71366","senseId":"2","lemma":"차리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차리겠구나","audio":"/audio/700c6b94711bde9a212f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"5f58ab67054aac9b","term":"실컷","zh":"狠狠地","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3","entryId":"14126","definition":"非常厉害地。","pronunciation":["실컫"]},{"id":"b4d47e56735ffcb5","term":"혼나다","zh":"被大骂，被怒斥","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3","entryId":"87966","definition":"被严重指责或受罚。","pronunciation":["혼나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2c3d6b050d278eb5","term":"정신","zh":"精神","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3","entryId":"75789","definition":"对什么进行感知、思维、判断的力量。","pronunciation":["정신"]},{"id":"967898219777e9f4","term":"차리다","zh":"振作，抖擞","audio":"/audio/967898219777e9f4fca1.mp3","entryId":"71366","definition":"重新打起精神或提起劲头等。","pronunciation":["차리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ee2516f748c55403f2d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14126-2-6-2","ko":"잘못했어요. 다시는 안 그럴게요.","zh":"对不起，我不会再那样做了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘못했어요.","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못했어요","audio":"/audio/e5b11f3183d57de1c37a.mp3"}},{"text":"다시는","meaning":"再也","explanation":"다시：再也；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"7","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시는","audio":"/audio/108453d4ff64fc69a1a3.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"그럴게요.","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럴게요","audio":"/audio/9eb539f99e689c159527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再也","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"以后再。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aec18368bd6dda6a6ec5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14126","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":92,"sequenceScore":2.4901,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我不会再那样做了。","护理学院的学生们是如何进行专业实习的？","你得好好挨顿骂才能醒醒脑吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我不会再那样做了。","你得好好挨顿骂才能醒醒脑吧。","护理学院的学生们是如何进行专业实习的？"],"answer":0}]}
